WEBVTT

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:25.960
Saint Seiya

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:52.620
Miss Saori, wait for me. I'll be there.

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:54.990
As a Saint of hope,

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:57.990
Shion has entrusted us with the Athena Cloth.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:00.500
I will deliver it to you.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:03.290
So...

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:04.880
So..

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:07.890
Don't die!

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:11.940
Miss Saori!

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:20.460
Cross Over! Acheron River

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:24.230
At the bottom of this pit is the Underworld.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.990
That is where Athena, or Miss Saori is.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:31.690
I hope Seiya remains alive.

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:33.260
Yes, of course.

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:35.400
Let us also go to the Underworld.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:36.170
Wait.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:38.000
Are you suicidal?

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:39.540
Who are you?

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:42.550
This Cosmo is connected to our own.

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:44.520
What? So that means...

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:51.410
Exactly. I am Shiryu's master,
the Libra Gold Saint, Dohko.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.270
Grand Master?

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:56.400
The Underworld is for the land of the dead.

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:01.300
The Specters are protected under
Hades, the Lord of the Underworld.

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:04.820
They are able to freely move between worlds.

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:12.750
Others will die before they reach the
Underworld, just as it is written.

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:15.000
So what about Seiya?

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.640
Is he dead?

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:21.820
He may be. But if Seiya has
awakened his Inner Consciousness,

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.800
he may have reached the Underworld alive.

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:27.640
The Inner Consciousness?

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:32.270
The Inner Consciousness is what
Shaka wrote on a flower petal

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.380
and entrusted it to Athena.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:35.770
His dying message.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:40.820
Alaya-vijnana

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:46.380
That's not a dying message. Shaka
wanted Athena to make a decision.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:47.550
A decision?

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:48.330
That's right.

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:52.820
To defeat Hades, you need to
get to the Underworld alive.

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:56.530
That's why it's necessary to
realize your Inner Consciousness.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:02.930
In Buddhism, it refers to
something hidden or the root.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:07.350
The Inner Consciousness, also
known as the Eighth Consciousness.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:08.380
The Eighth Consciousness?

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:09.810
What does that mean?

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:11.240
That's right,

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:15.540
the one above the Seventh
Sense, the ultimate Cosmo.

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:17.070
The Eighth Sense.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:19.150
The Eighth Sense?

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.400
I see. Now I understand.

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:25.810
Athena and Shaka didn't
give up on the battle.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:31.820
They drove themselves to the edge of
death to awaken to their Eighth Sense.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.670
So they could enter the Underworld.

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:40.300
And to defeat Lord Hades.

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:45.760
Right. I will follow Athena
and Shaka into the Underworld

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.410
and defeat Hades.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:49.590
Grand Master, I will go too.

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:50.300
You must not.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:51.400
But...

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:56.070
We have the duty to deliver the Athena Cloth.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:58.400
You guys...

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:04.920
Grand Master, didn't you mean it
when you said we'll die together?

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.040
It's impossible to stop you, then.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.260
We must realize our Eighth Sense.

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:19.840
As it was you who caused numerous miracles,

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:23.060
and it was you who bore the Cloths
doused with Athena's blood.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.740
You may be able to do it.

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:28.220
Let's go, young Saints of hope!

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:52.900
Where am I?

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.400
Have I reached the Underworld?

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:01.620
The land of the dead where Hades presides.

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:03.580
Shun.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:10.550
Are you okay, Shun?

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:13.420
Seiya.

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:17.600
Shun, you jumped into the
pit to the Underworld too?

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:22.570
Not just me. Hyoga, Shiryu
and Grand Master too.

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:26.570
I'm glad, you must have
realized your Eighth Sense.

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:28.930
Eighth Sense?

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:33.330
I see. Miss Saori and Shaka

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.680
had come down to the Underworld to get Hades.

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:42.080
So we must deliver Athena's Cloth
to Miss Saori as soon as possible.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.500
Right. I know.

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:57.990
What's this?

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.240
What is this gate?

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:05.480
I've heard about this. It's Hell's Gate.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.630
Something is written on it.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:11.740
"To enter, abandon all hope."

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.960
"Abandon hope"?

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:16.380
How awful.

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:23.550
Hope is the one last thing
a person can hold onto.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:25.440
And to throw that away...

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.670
We won't throw it away.

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:28.500
Seiya.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:34.360
We're Saints of hope, right?

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.580
Seiya.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:45.510
The Saints have arrived in the Underworld.

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:51.400
There are seven, no, eight of them.

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:54.420
Lord Hades.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.270
Shun, is this an ocean?

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:03.500
No, it flows like a river.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:10.290
I see, this must be the Styx River.

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:19.680
Who are these people and why are they crying?

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:30.100
They're the ones who have
lived their lives aimlessly.

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:35.360
So even after their death they
cannot enter heaven nor hell.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:41.800
They are stranded on the shores
of Acheron between worlds.

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:43.510
Forever.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:46.660
Who are you?

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:51.740
I am the ferryman to hell, Acheron Charon.

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.470
You guys are alive?

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:59.970
Only the dead and Specters are
allowed on the shores of Acheron.

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.640
Who are you?

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:04.440
Athena's Saint, Pegasus Seiya.

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:07.610
Athena's Saint, Andromeda Shun.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:09.640
Athena's Saint?

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:14.190
So you're the intruders I was warned about.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:17.990
In that case, I can't let
you cross the Acheron River.

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:20.220
Try it if you can.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.200
What?

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:28.120
Pegasus!

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:29.170
Fool!

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:31.170
Meteor Punch!

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:34.300
Rolling Oar!

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.010
The Meteor Punch was blocked.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:38.630
Die!

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:42.620
You!

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:44.730
Don't forget I'm here.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:49.680
Damn punks, do you want to
cross the river that much?

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:55.890
We'll cross. I didn't abandon
hope at Hell's Gate.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.660
Me neither.

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:59.410
Damn bastards.

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:04.330
As you insist, I'll let you on the ferry.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:06.240
Really?

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:10.210
But do you guys have money?

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:17.590
The dead pay me silver coins
to cross to the other side.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:21.540
Fool, we won't pay you anything!

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:22.680
Wait, Seiya.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.450
Shun.

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:35.720
They're not silver coins,
but will you accept this?

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:36.950
Shun.

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:42.840
This is gold, and quite expensive.

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:45.870
Shun.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:47.590
Where did you get that?

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:51.230
I've had it for as long as I can remember.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:56.610
Brother Ikki said it probably
belonged to our mother.

00:10:56.780 --> 00:11:00.050
You can't give away something so precious.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:01.590
It's all right, Seiya.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:05.000
If it means we don't have
to fight unnecessarily,

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:08.520
we can prevent injury just with that pendant.

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:10.940
What more can we ask for?

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:11.940
But...

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:18.900
Fine, it's not enough, but I'll
take it. Now, get on the ferry.

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:23.720
I set sail with the dead aboard

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:31.000
Hey, brats, don't be mesmerized by
my singing and fall off the ferry.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:33.520
Dummy, no one is listening.

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:36.770
So when will we reach the other side?

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:42.590
Be patient, kid. The Acheron River is
not like your puny rivers on Earth.

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:45.260
We're still only halfway.

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:47.430
Still halfway?

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:52.710
This is the Acheron River's
deepest and coldest part.

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:55.860
It is also where you'll be getting off!

00:11:56.890 --> 00:11:57.850
What?

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:03.770
Seiya!

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:07.330
I told you the pendant wasn't enough.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:07.910
What?

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:15.540
You can't float or swim in the Acheron River.

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:18.900
Not only that, the river is
filled with the dead souls

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:22.420
who drowned attempting to cross.

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:23.600
Seiya!

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:30.810
Now you'll get pulled down by
the dead and suffer forever!

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:33.490
Shun.

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:35.010
Seiya!

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:41.060
Seiya, I'll pull you out now.

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:44.680
Stay out of it! He was
trying to ride for free.

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:50.990
But I'll let you ride because
you gave me this pendant.

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:54.210
Now, let go of the chain.

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:54.960
No.

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:56.250
Let go!

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.250
No!

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:02.920
Then you go in as well.

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:04.680
What?

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:11.430
Charon, the fight is not over!

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:12.850
You! You're still...

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:15.350
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:22.330
Idiot, your Meteor Punch is
no match for my Rolling Oar.

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:24.460
What's this?

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:27.620
His punches are getting past my oar.

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:28.710
Charon.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:32.700
The same technique doesn't work twice
on a Saint who has seen it once.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.290
Take this! Meteor Punch!

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:45.330
We must have somehow
realized our Eighth Sense

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:47.070
and come to the Underworld.

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:48.020
Right.

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:51.550
But we got separated from
Shun and Grand Master.

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:57.390
It's all right. As long as we're headed
to Hades, we'll see them again.

00:13:57.880 --> 00:13:59.580
Of course, Seiya too.

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:06.000
Seiya, are you all right?

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:09.700
You saved me, Shun. It was a
mistake letting my guard down.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:13.620
Hey, help me! I'm drowning!

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:17.620
Now you're being pulled down by the dead.

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:23.580
If you don't help me, you won't
make it to the other side.

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:24.680
What?

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:31.550
Even if you have the ferry,
you'll wander aimlessly forever.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:36.260
Only I know how to cross the river.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:37.780
Seiya.

00:14:38.030 --> 00:14:42.240
Hurry! I'll take you to
the other side this time!

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.690
Nebula Chain!

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:46.510
Shun.

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:51.350
We have no choice if we want
to cross the river, Seiya.

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:54.230
I don't trust what he says.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.150
He'll attack us again.

00:14:58.280 --> 00:14:59.330
I'll trust him.

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:00.610
Shun.

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:05.990
There's no other option but to trust him.

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:08.210
Don't blame me if something happens.

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:16.030
You saved me. Now, give me the oar.

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:20.270
What's wrong? You want to get
to the other side, right?

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:21.700
Seiya.

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:24.220
Fine, here.

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:27.850
I'll tell you,

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:29.900
there's no such thing as goodwill in hell.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:31.090
What?

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:38.320
Seiya!

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:41.780
I'm all right, Shun. I was
expecting this, so I was ready.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:46.660
I won't let go of the oar.

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:50.040
Without it, you have no means to attack.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:52.130
You really think so?

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:53.830
What?

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:58.560
I have powers other than the oar.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.510
Here's my ultimate move!

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:03.160
Ending Current Crusher!

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:08.110
Seiya!

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:13.200
Fool, worry about yourself
before you worry about others.

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:15.070
That's treachery!

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:20.290
What's wrong? You're the
fool who trusted the enemy.

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:23.710
Die and regret your naiveté!

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:31.220
Seiya, I'm sorry. I did something foolish.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.680
But... I...

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:46.480
I quit.

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:52.860
I've never seen anyone with eyes like yours.

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:59.160
Those who enter the Underworld were
bad people while they were alive,

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:03.340
so their eyes reveal their depravity.

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:05.720
However, your eyes reveal
something different.

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:11.470
Even after my betrayal, your eyes show
you are still willing to trust me.

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:14.380
You're a strange kid.

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:21.040
Maybe when people like you
die, they go to Elysion.

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:22.190
Elysion?

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:25.610
It's paradise.

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:31.240
It's said to be somewhere upstream,
beyond the Lethe River.

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:34.160
Unfortunately, I've never seen it.

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:38.750
It's in the same Underworld,
but for us servants of hell,

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:42.190
we have no business being there.

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:48.030
Seiya, you're conscious.

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:49.900
Shun.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:52.110
You.

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.350
You were saved again, kid.

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:59.760
Thanks to the kid with the
chain for saving my life.

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.730
I'll take you to the other side.

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:04.470
What's going on?

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:09.570
It's true, Seiya. He also
returned the pendant.

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:10.920
What?

00:18:13.260 --> 00:18:15.570
Why? I don't believe it.

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:18.810
And I still owe you some change.

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:23.150
That's how much my life is worth.

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:26.990
But once we reach the other side, we're even.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:29.390
That's when you should be prepared.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:32.880
All right. I'm ready to do this.

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.610
I can see it now.

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:39.590
That's the First Prison.

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:40.800
What?

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.370
The First Prison?

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:47.230
Beyond the shore are eight Prisons,

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:47.240
three Valleys and 10 Malboges.
Beyond the shore are eight Prisons,

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:50.220
three Valleys and 10 Malboges.

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:52.550
Also, four Spheres

00:18:52.550 --> 00:18:57.450
where the dark, endless
landscape of hell continues.

00:18:58.220 --> 00:19:01.410
I don't know how far Athena has ventured,

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:05.500
but it's impossible to reach Lord Hades.

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:11.390
No, you're wrong. Athena,
Miss Saori is still fighting.

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:12.860
Let's hurry, Shun.

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:15.430
Wait!

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:21.050
Before you leave, we need
to settle your debt.

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:26.000
Right. I was in a hurry, I almost forgot.

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.200
Shun, stay out of it this time.

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:29.070
Seiya.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:32.710
If he defeats me, just
go on ahead. All right?

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:34.430
Seiya.

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:38.740
Charon, I've seen enough of your abilities.

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:42.440
You can't stop me.

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:47.970
I will finish you off for
sure this time, you brat.

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:04.630
Ending Current Crusher!

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:07.760
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:15.570
Seiya!

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:26.990
Were you saying something?

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:38.630
An attack you've seen once

00:20:38.930 --> 00:20:40.850
won't work twice.

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:44.930
Damn it.

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:49.830
That might be true.

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:09.970
Seiya, are you hurt?

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:12.800
I'm all right, just scratched up.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:13.950
I'm relieved.

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:29.260
Let's go, Shun, to the First Prison.

00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:08.210
Brother Ikki, I'll get to Miss Saori.

00:22:08.210 --> 00:22:09.230
I promise.

00:22:09.230 --> 00:22:12.570
What a long stairway!

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:15.180
We've been climbing since
the shores of Acheron.

00:22:19.390 --> 00:22:20.350
Seiya.

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:23.590
That...

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:25.520
...is the First Prison.

00:22:27.230 --> 00:22:28.930
The Judgment House.

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:06.080
The First Prison: The Judgment House.

00:24:06.640 --> 00:24:12.250
From the silent darkness, a man with
cruel eyes gets in the way of the Saints.

00:24:12.490 --> 00:24:14.400
The voice of judgment resonates.

00:24:14.810 --> 00:24:18.080
All of our sins start to tear us apart.

00:24:18.850 --> 00:24:19.610
Are these...

00:24:19.990 --> 00:24:21.510
The sins that I have commited?

00:24:22.510 --> 00:24:25.200
Saint Seiya: "The Tribunal of Silence."

00:24:25.480 --> 00:24:28.360
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
